+# liblouis: Nemeth Table for mathematics
+#
+#  Based on the Linux screenreader BRLTTY, copyright (C) 1999-2006 by
+#  The BRLTTY Team
+#
+#  Copyright (C) 2004, 2005, 2006
+#  ViewPlus Technologies, Inc. www.viewplus.com
+#  and
